          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 pt-4 pb-2">
        <h2 class="adt-h2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900" data-id="pg120_n0004">Si riciklohen mbetjet?</h2>
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 h-1 w-full max-w-md bg-purple-400 rounded-full"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5">
      <span data-id="pg120_n0006">Malit i kishin r&#xeb;n&#xeb; n&#xeb; sy vazhdimisht disa shenja n&#xeb; shport&#xeb;n e plehrave n&#xeb; oborrin e shkoll&#xeb;s.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0007">Madje kishte d&#xeb;gjuar dhe p&#xeb;r rregull&#xeb;n &#x201c;R - rip&#xeb;rdor, riciklo dhe redukto&#x201d;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0008">Ndoshta se nuk ishte shum&#xeb; i interesuar at&#xeb;koh&#xeb;, prandaj nuk e kishte kuptuar dhe aq mir&#xeb; k&#xeb;t&#xeb; rregull.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0009">Kur m&#xeb;suesja filloi t&#xeb; fliste se si mbeturinat nuk duhej t&#xeb; hidheshin t&#xeb; gjitha n&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb;n shport&#xeb;, por ato duhej t&#xeb; klasifikoheshin, atij iu kujtua pse ekzistonte rregulla &#x201c;&#x201d;.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5">
      <span data-id="pg120_n0011">Q&#xeb;llimi i k&#xeb;saj rregulle ishte q&#xeb; t&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zoheshin sa m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; produktet.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0012">- M&#xeb;suese, a po flisni p&#xeb;r riciklimin? - pyeti Mali.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0013">- Pik&#xeb;risht, Mali, t&#xeb; lumt&#xeb;!</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0014">Mir&#xeb;po, po flas dhe p&#xeb;r rip&#xeb;rdorimin dhe reduktimin.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0015">P.sh., ti mund t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rdor&#xeb;sh &#xe7;ant&#xeb;n e nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r shum&#xeb; vjet n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0016">Mund t&#xeb; punosh ndonj&#xeb; dekor dhe ta zbukurosh &#xe7;do vit &#xe7;ant&#xeb;n, n&#xeb; vend q&#xeb; t&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkosh t&#xeb; blesh nj&#xeb; t&#xeb; re.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0017">Apo, t&#x2019;i fal&#xeb;sh lodrat e tua.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0018">K&#xeb;shtu, ne kemi rip&#xeb;rdorur materiale t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5">
      <span data-id="pg120_n0020">Ju lutem, kudo q&#xeb; e shihni shenj&#xeb;n e riciklimit, t&#xeb; hidhni vet&#xeb;m materialet q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; riciklohen, si: shishet e plastik&#xeb;s, letr&#xeb;n e past&#xeb;r, shishet e xhamit apo kana&#xe7;et e pijeve t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5">
      <span data-id="pg120_n0022">Ju duhet t&#xeb; ndani mbeturinat edhe n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pit&#xeb; tuaja.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0023">Rrobat apo gj&#xeb;rat q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; riciklohen, t&#x2019;i p&#xeb;rdorni sa m&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mundeni.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0024">Kur t&#xeb; mos ju b&#xeb;jn&#xeb; m&#xeb;, mund t&#x2019;ua dhuroni njer&#xeb;zve n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-5">
      <span data-id="pg120_n0026">Mali dhe shok&#xeb;t e shoqet t&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s u g&#xeb;zuan shum&#xeb;, sepse menduan q&#xeb; kishin shum&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra n&#xeb; dor&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; ruajtur ambientin.</span>
      <span data-id="pg120_n0027">Mezi po prisnin q&#xeb; t&#xeb; sistemonin lodrat e vegj&#xeb;lis&#xeb; e rrobat e tyre, me q&#xeb;llim q&#xeb; t&#x2019;ua dhuronin f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-8">
      <span data-id="pg120_n0029">Mali propozoi q&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t t&#xeb; vizatonin simbolin e riciklimit dhe ta vendosnin at&#xeb; n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; prej shportave t&#xeb; mbeturinave n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi.</span>
    </p>

    <aside class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-purple-50 overflow-hidden mb-8">
      <div class="flex max-lg:flex-col">
        <div class="bg-purple-500 text-white flex items-start justify-center px-6 py-6 w-24 max-lg:w-full">
          <div aria-hidden="true">&#x1f4d8;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 p-6">
          <p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-4 italic">
            <span data-id="pg120_n0032">Riciklimi &#xeb;sht&#xeb; ndarja e materialeve nga mbeturinat dhe rip&#xeb;rdorimi i tyre.</span>
            <span data-id="pg120_n0033">Ai p&#xeb;rfshin mbledhjen, ndarjen, p&#xeb;rpunimin dhe prodhimin e produkteve t&#xeb; reja nga sendet ose materialet e p&#xeb;rdorura.</span>
            <span data-id="pg120_n0034">Shum&#xeb; mbeturina mund t&#xeb; rip&#xeb;rdoren n&#xeb;se grumbullohen ve&#xe7;mas.</span>
          </p>
          <p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-4 italic">
            <span data-id="pg120_n0036">&#xcb;sht&#xeb; shum&#xeb; e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme q&#xeb; s&#xeb; pari t&#xeb; ndahen mbetjet sipas llojeve t&#xeb; mbeturinave.</span>
            <span data-id="pg120_n0037">Duhet t&#xeb; kemi kujdes kur i klasifikojm&#xeb; mbeturinat, sepse mbeturinat e riciklueshme duhet t&#x2019;i hedhim n&#xeb; koshin e caktuar.</span>
          </p>
          <p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed italic">
            <span data-id="pg120_n0039">Materialet q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; riciklohen jan&#xeb;: letra, metalet, si: alumini, &#xe7;eliku, produktet e qelqit etj.</span>
            <span data-id="pg120_n0040">Krijimi i plehrave nga mbetjet organike &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nj&#xeb; tjet&#xeb;r shembull i mir&#xeb; i riciklimit.</span>
            <span data-id="pg120_n0041">Pa futjen e riciklimit n&#xeb; jet&#xeb;n e p&#xeb;rditshme, do t&#xeb; jet&#xeb; e pamundshme t&#xeb; imagjinohet nj&#xeb; sistem i rregullt i mbeturinave.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
