        <span data-id="pg120_n0044" class="font-semibold">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>
        <span data-id="pg120_n0045">kujdes, mbeturin&#xeb;, riciklim, p&#xeb;rfitim.</span>
